{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "PSA",
 "chapter": 13,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.13.1",
   "range": "PSA.13.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cea7cc4f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.13.1#p1-cea7cc4f",
     "text": "He declares that his afflictions lasted a long time, and that his faith did not waver.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "for ever"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.13.2",
   "range": "PSA.13.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7837fe82",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.13.2#p1-7837fe82",
     "text": "Changing my purposes as the sick man does his place.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "counsel in my soul"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.13.4",
   "range": "PSA.13.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e3cce424",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.13.4#p1-e3cce424",
     "text": "Which might turn to God's dishonour: if he did not defend his.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "prevailed against him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.13.5",
   "range": "PSA.13.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "16ce8440",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.13.5#p1-16ce8440",
     "text": "The mercy of God is the cause of our salvation.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "mercy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PSA.13.6",
   "range": "PSA.13.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c1b41f72",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PSA.13.6#p1-c1b41f72",
     "text": "Both by the benefits past and by others to come.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "dealt bountifully with me"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
